    <string name="raws_my_filters_format">Use network rules like ||ads.example^ and @@ for exceptions. Hide elements with news.example##div.ad-slot, cancel that exact hide with news.example#@#div.ad-slot, or use ##.ad-slot for all sites. Exceptions apply only to your rules. Site rules can use id, class or data- attributes, for example news.example##[class^=\&quot;ad-\&quot;]. Scripts, styles, regex and redirects aren’t supported. Reload open pages after saving.</string>
